.TH MERMAN-CLI-THEME-LIST 1 2026-08-15 "Merman 0.11.0" "Merman CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
merman\-cli\-theme\-list \- List native presets and their default\-appearance swatches
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmerman\-cli theme list\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List native presets and their default\-appearance swatches
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the shared theme catalog as JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH VERSION
v0.11.0
